        'Hi everyone, it\'s Markus from the eco team. About the reply to Riverside Academy: please tell them that the food challenge worked best, because food waste went down by fifty percent. The hardest challenge was the heating, because some teachers complained. Our tip is to show students the results every day on the screen in the hall. People love numbers! And yes, Kaisa and I would love to visit Leeds. Please write the e-mail by Wednesday.',
